    "version": "1.0.0",
    "author": "Wlad Radchenko",
    "author_email": "i@wladradchenko.ru",
    "description": "A language model that drives the application through MCP: it runs the editor with the same tools an outside agent would, either on this machine or by handing the keys to Claude Code.",
